        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fatty acids, from vegetarian oil, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fatty acids, from vegetarian oil, at plant
The functional unit is 1 kg of fatty acids - based on the oil from soya, palm, palm kernel and coco nuts. ;
UUID: c01e041a-1d02-3456-874d-164d6bc5d142
Energy consumption, water and raw materials and waste. Emissions to air according to methodology of database. No emissions to water.
Location: data from different European producers - therefore representing a European average
Technology: No information about techonology given.
Time period: according to used literature source
Production volume: worldwide 902 kt in 1994
Sampling: Process data based on information from European producers. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c01e041a-1d02-3456-874d-164d6bc5d142.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
